meta {
  name: 23 Customer Returns
  seq: 23
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Customer returns (RMA) of delivered items, /api/v1/Returns:
  Requested -> Approved (return shipment receiver -> sender) -> Received (when it's delivered),
  or Requested -> Rejected / Cancelled. Each item gets RETURN_REQUESTED with its own reason.

  A Bangkok -> Chiang Mai shipment (no legs, no signature) is delivered first. RMA 1 returns
  A and B and is auto-routed back over the return lanes from 21; item C goes through
  reject, cancel, then approve without routing and delivery (Received).
}
